/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 107 0 R
/E (Riddle Game is a simple console-based Java application in which the player is shown randomly selected riddles and enters an answer. The program checks the answer without considering letter case, increases the score for a correct response, and provides an optional hint when the answer is incorrect. The player can continue playing or exit at any time. The project demonstrates fundamental Java programming)
