/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (The Riddle Game successfully demonstrates how basic Java programming concepts can be combined to create an interactive application. The project uses arrays for data storage, random number generation for question selection, Scanner for input, string comparison for answer checking, conditions for decision-making, and a loop for repeated gameplay. It provides a strong beginner-level foundation for developing larger Java applications.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
